            "review_title": "Review at Aranya Rooftop Café & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Robert J\nBoston, Massachusetts10 contributions\n0\nLooking for somewhere to watch the city sunset? You came to the right place.\nAug 2014 • Solo\nHappened to go here purely by chances, as I was tired after few hours of walking around the old town. Ordered a cup of coffee and a cream cake, I took a seat in the balcony area and I was \"wow\", as the sun went down under the horizon. That was the best picture I took while I was in Hanoi!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 24, 2014",
