            "review_title": "Review at Aranya Rooftop Café & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Daniel B\nStevensville, Maryland10 contributions\n0\nLovely cafe.\nMay 2014 • Friends\nI nearly forgot this lovely little cafe shop. After taking some stroll around the Old Quarter area, we went to this cafe (as it's located at the 7th floor, the highest one around - it will give us better view over the Old Quarter) and ordered some cups of black and milk coffee, with some apple pancakes. Both of them were very good, the coffee here had a really strong flavor. Combined with an excellent view from the balcony, this really made our day.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 23, 2014",
