            "review_text": "Kevin J\nNew Jersey7 contributions\n0\nAuthentic local cuisine.\nApr 2014 • Friends\nAranya Rooftop was a lovely little restaurant at the 7th floor, and the view from the balcony here was just perfect, you'll have an excellent view over the Old Quarter area. We had vermicelli with grilled pork (dipped in sauce) with pho with beef here for our lunch, both of them were very good - especially the vermicelli. The sauce had a really distinctive taste and the pork was tender and perfectly-seasoned. Even for being a hotel restaurant, this was amazing!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 20, 2014",
