            "review_title": "Review at Aranya Rooftop Café & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Kerrie S\nCanberra, Australia11 contributions\n0\nOver rated\nNov 2014\nIn a city full of amazing restaurants and against our better judgement (as it's a hotel restaurant) we went here as Trip Advisor reviews were good - rated at #14 in Hanoi - also a few doors along from our lovely little hotel. \nIt's on the 7th floor so has good views, \"smoking\" room on balcony outside restaurant has the best views!!\nFood just ok, not sure why rated so highly. We had a spicy pork chop (which was very tough ribs) and a Vietnamese dish - ok. We were still hungry and thought about dessert, but were presented with bill and rushed out. Not sure why, as it wasn't late and the only other lone diner (warning sign) was still eating!!\nIf you want very average, bland, safe, hotel food it's fine. But really.....not #14.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 20, 2014",
